  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nYou can discard 1 card; add 1 face-up Dragon
    Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck to your hand. You can only use this effect
    of \"Odd-Eyes Phantasma Dragon\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you
    have 2 cards in your Pendulum Zones and a face-up \"Odd-Eyes\" Pendulum Monster
    in your Extra Deck: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. You cannot
    Pendulum Summon the turn you activate this effect. During damage calculation,
    if this card attacks an opponent's monster: You can make that opponent's monster
    lose 1000 ATK for each face-up Pendulum Monster in your Extra Deck, during damage
    calculation only. You can only use each effect of \"Odd-Eyes Phantasma Dragon\"
    once per turn."
